{
  "v": 1,
  "about": "Same room (Tin Hat 11.3) — shared test vectors for the room-mic election and the raw-level tracker. Byte-identical in the desktop repo (crates/streamer/src/sameroom/vectors.json) and the web repo (src/features/calls/sameroom/vectors.json). Levels are SNR dB (signal above the mic's own noise floor). A step runs one election tick with the carried state; `expect` is checked after the tick. A challenger needs winTicks consecutive winning ticks (50 ms each); a peer level older than staleMs is silent; callers feed each peer's level as the MAX of its packets from the last holdMs (so one quiet packet in flight at a speech onset cannot flip the mic). Floor tracker: the floor starts at the first window's level (clamped to [floorMinDb, floorMaxDb]); each later window below the floor becomes the floor, otherwise the floor rises by floorRiseDbPerWin; SNR = round(window - floor) clamped to [0, snrMaxDb].",
  "const": {
    "speechDb": 6,
    "marginDb": 3,
    "winTicks": 4,
    "staleMs": 400,
    "holdMs": 150,
    "floorRiseDbPerWin": 0.025,
    "floorMinDb": -90,
    "floorMaxDb": -20,
    "snrMaxDb": 60
  },
